msgid "6. Clock output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/ade9000.rst:210
msgid ""
"The ADE9000 can provide a clock output via the CLKOUT pin when using an "
"external crystal/clock source. This feature is enabled by specifying "
"``#clock-cells = <0>`` in the device tree. The output clock will be "
"registered as \"clkout\" and can be referenced by other devices."
msgstr ""

